PhotoCraft (https://github.com/storytold/photocraft) — photocraft-geom, photocraft-color,
photocraft-raster, photocraft-paint (brush engine, tiled surfaces, blend modes).
Copyright (c) 2026 ArtCraft Team and the PhotoCraft contributors. MIT OR Apache-2.0.

VectorCraft (https://github.com/storytold/vectorcraft) — planned for the vector tools.
